{#- Advance Scene: what the scene description is, and how it is written (creator.advance-scene) -#}
The scene description is the backdrop of the story, shown in every prompt: where and when the story takes place, the setting and its atmosphere, and the situation the characters are in.

It should be written as a present-tense overview of the current setting and situation, not as a recap of recent events or a play-by-play of the dialogue.
